## 2026-05-03 (update 6) — Audit Trail (Editing History)

### New Google Sheet: Audit_Log
New 5th worksheet with 11 columns:
AuditID | Timestamp | TermID | TermChinese | UserEmail | UserName |
ActionType | FieldChanged | OldValue | NewValue | Details

AuditID uses timestamp-based format (A + YYYYMMDDHHMMSSμs) to avoid ID collisions.
Created automatically by "⚙ Init Sheets" (`ensure_headers()`).

### Backend: write_audit() Helper
New `write_audit(term_id, term_chinese, user_email, user_name, action_type, ...)` function.
Appends one row per event to Audit_Log. Silently swallows all exceptions so audit
failures never break the main operation.

Hooked into all state-changing operations:

| Route | Action type written |
|-------|-------------------|
| `api_add_term()` | `created` |
| `api_update_term()` PATCH | `updated` (with old + new value) |
| `api_vote()` | `voted` or `vote_updated` (captures old vote) |
| `api_set_final()` which=first | `finalized_first` |
| `api_set_final()` which=second | `finalized_second` |
| `api_reset_final()` | `reset_final` (captures old first/second) |
| `api_translate_term()` | `ai_translated` (one row per slot filled) |

### New API Endpoint
`GET /api/terms/<term_id>/audit` — returns all Audit_Log rows for the term,
sorted by Timestamp descending.

### Edit View: Editing History Section
New `.audit-section` div rendered at the bottom of every Edit View.
`loadAuditLog(termId)` fetches the audit endpoint and renders a styled table:
Time | User | Action (colored badge) | Details.

Action badge colors:
- Created: green; Updated: blue; Voted/Vote Changed: amber;
- Finalized 1st/2nd: gold; Reset Final: red; AI Translated: teal.

`loadAuditLog()` is called from both `openEditView()` and `refreshEditView()`
so the history stays current after votes, saves, and finalizations.

