## 2026-05-03 (update 4) — Final Reset, Badges, AI Translate, Category Removed

### Final Reset
New `POST /api/terms/<id>/final/reset` endpoint (leader/admin only): clears TranslationFirst,
TranslationSecond, Final, sets status → "pending", writes LastModifiedBy/Time.
Frontend `resetFinal()` calls it after confirm dialog. Button (`↺ Final Reset`) appears in
`buildEditView` only when `t.trans_first || t.trans_second` is truthy. Members never see it.

### Final Badges — 1st and 2nd
Old `.final-badge` CSS removed. Two new badge classes:
- `.final-badge-1st` — gold fill, dark text (strong/bright)
- `.final-badge-2nd` — translucent gold background, amber text, gold border (soft)

In `transPanel()`, `isFinal` → split into `isFirst` (key === `t.final`) and
`isSecond` (key === `findKeyByText(t, t.trans_second)`). Both badges can appear on the same
panel if first and second point to the same option.

### Bold Text for Finalized Translations
`transPanel()` computes `bold = isFirst || isSecond`. When true, the locked `<div class="tp-text">`
gets `style="font-weight:600;"`. Applies only to the rendered (locked/finalized) div, not editable textareas.

### Category Field Removed from Edit UI
The Category `<select>` and its `categoryOpts` computation are removed from `buildEditView`.
The column data and backend PATCH support remain intact. Notes field promoted to full-width
(`meta-field full`) now that it no longer shares its row with Category.

### AI Translate Button
`buildEditView` shows `✦ AI Translate` button in the autopicks bar when any of
`t.trans1`, `t.trans2`, or `t.trans3` is empty. Once all are filled the button disappears.
- Backend: `POST /api/terms/<id>/translate` — checks empty+unlocked options, calls
  `generate_missing_translations()` (new helper using claude-haiku-4-5-20251001),
  writes only to empty slots, respects vote locks, returns `{translations, last_modified_by, ...}`.
- Frontend: `aiTranslate()` disables button, shows "⏳ Generating…", patches term in memory,
  calls `refreshEditView()` on success. On error, restores button without touching existing data.

